  "limits": [
    "Writer retains sample header metadata proportional to column count, one input batch and one reusable record buffer; native execution may sort/materialize/spill according to its own action plan. No constant total RSS claim.",
    "Parser retains at most128 shared FORMAT plans plus its current plan, token scratch proportional to the largest record, and bounded output batches. Unrequested fields keep the declared Arrow schema with typed null placeholders. Batch budget includes declared fields, including placeholder buffers.",
    "Projection pass memoizes original expression nodes, paths and owning lexical scopes, and traverses supported unary chains once. Unknown table operations remain conservative boundaries; no universal source pruning claim.",
    "Full action timings at growing projection depth include existing Vail/DataFusion planning/optimization costs; they do not establish linear total planning complexity. No dependency implementations changed."
  ]
